This confirms the disbursement schedule + documentation for the USD 80 million ECB facility under the Facility Agreement dated 22 September 2024 between Acme Corp Pvt Ltd (Borrower) and NorthWind Capital Inc / NorthWind Capital India Pvt Ltd (Lender). HDFC Bank serves as facility agent for the Indian leg.

