RBI CONSTRAINTS:
Per the RBI ECB Master Direction (last updated July 2024):
- All-in-cost ceiling: SOFR + 450 bps — our pricing of SOFR + 350 bps is well within
- Minimum average maturity: 5 years — our tenor of 7 years complies
- End-use: working capital + capex (NOT for buyback, dividend, real-estate speculation) — Acme's stated use cases comply

